OL,3,AAt least 16 killed in attack on mosque
OL,4,Ain Pakistan
OL,5,
OL,6,FAt least 16 people, including five
OL,7,Fpolice officers, have been killed after
OL,8,Fa vehicle loaded with explosives rammed
OL,9,Finto a mosque in north-western
OL,10,FPakistan, according to a senior police
OL,11,Fofficial in Peshawar.
OL,13,FA gun battle is still ongoing between
OL,14,Fattackers and security forces at the
OL,15,Fsite in the Kohat district of Khyber
OL,16,FPakhtunkhwa.
OL,18,FOne of the assailants has reportedly
OL,19,Fbeen killed, an officer says, and a
OL,20,Frescue operation is under way.
OL,23,APub: 18-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
